<title>LITHUANIA: EKRANAS POSTS 7 MO 11.1 MLN LITAS NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>EKRANAS POSTS 7 MO 11.1 MLN LITAS NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first seven months of 1997</p>
<p>					  (amounts in million litas)</p>
<p>    Net profit			11.1 vs   59.4</p>
<p>    Profit from operations	 9.6 vs   5.0</p>
<p>    Sales and services	   157.2 vs   185.4</p>
<p>Notes: Television tubes producer Ekranas said that</p>
<p>the government wrote off 53 million litas in debts and overdue</p>
<p>payments in 1996.</p>
<p>The firm posted an 8.58 million litas net profit and 137.16</p>
<p>million litas turnover in the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
